						<div class="journal-content-article">
							<div class="internalPage">
    <div>
        <h3>BOLLETTINI FITOSANITARI - ANNO 2026</h3>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h4>Calendario mensile dei recapiti dell'U.O. Fitosanitario</h4>
<p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Mensilmente, sono pubblicate le date, orari e luogo dei recapiti di settore (viticolo, frutticolo e orticolo).</span></p>
<p><img alt="" src="/documents/11979050/14283519/PDF.png/ec23209c-5990-4391-a534-36b847a48868?t=1761847355933" style="height: 28px; width: 28px;"><a href="/documents/11979050/14331623/Calendario+recapiti_2026_SETTEMBRE.pdf/1311ff1b-e564-4ae0-b0d9-b172802c6677"><strong>SETTEMBRE</strong></a> -&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14331623/Calendario+recapiti_2026_AGOSTO.pdf/4cab5e05-7f3e-4cce-b4c3-2a520aaf63cf">AGOSTO</a> -&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14331623/Calendario+recapiti_2026_LUGLIO.pdf/446b3a3d-5dba-4788-ae99-52ed743006fe">LUGLIO</a> -&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14331623/Calendario+recapiti_2026_GIUGNOv2.pdf/ce7237f3-6334-4665-9c52-1a988cbe319f">GIUGNO</a> -&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14331623/Calendario+recapiti_2026_MAGGIOv2.pdf/2bb306ed-bc35-46f8-8790-d32a8e5add2c">MAGGIO&nbsp;</a>-&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14331623/Calendario+recapiti+2026_04/1809247e-2164-421d-81c9-754b3dfdd9c5">APRILE</a> -&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14331623/Calendario+recapiti+2026_03_agg/894fb007-ad37-4e0a-be5e-8182debe504c">MARZO</a>&nbsp;-&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14331623/Calendario+recapiti+2026_02/bb91f0f6-5ef7-45a5-9a12-e111bdea02b8">FEBBRAIO</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h4><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Bollettini viticoli</span></h4>
<p><img alt="" src="/documents/11979050/14283519/PDF.png/ec23209c-5990-4391-a534-36b847a48868?t=1761847355933" style="height: 28px; width: 28px;"><a href="/documents/11979050/14345303/Bollettino_vite_20_270826.pdf/bac2bf94-b6c1-46d6-a608-1ff9cb82264d"><strong>N°20 del 27/08/2026</strong></a> -&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14345303/Bollettino_vite_19_130826.pdf/02067e4c-dbd4-4bcb-bdad-59dedb940991">N°19 del 13/08/2026</a> -&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14345303/Bollettino_vite_18_060826.pdf/832e8bcf-92d1-41be-b9b7-aeda35c98f04">N°18 del 06/08/2026</a> -&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14345303/Bollettino_vite_17_300726.pdf/87ec79f7-9b5e-4b17-a945-b1c98e72ab49">N°17 del 30/07/2026</a> -&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14345303/Bollettino+vite+16_22072026/7a35cd11-58ec-4564-9496-3e88ae5cb07e">N°16 del 22/07/2026 </a>-&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14345303/Bollettino+vite+n.15_150726/5813c7eb-b52f-4649-bb53-9e4d8c7809c3">N° 15 del 15/07/2026</a> -&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14345303/Bollettino_vite_14_080726.pdf/8a278578-8bbe-4cbb-ac02-16ee4a8c4b28">N°14 del 08/07/2026</a> -&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14345303/Bollettino_vite_13_010726.pdf/84437991-4672-4f6a-a768-b6fb263af380">N°13 del 01/07/2026</a> -&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14345303/Bollettino_vite_12_240626.pdf/91e0baab-5bde-4d7d-af80-95c41e5572b6">N°12 del 24/06/2026</a> -&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14345303/Bollettino_vite_11_170626.pdf/4c23ba1f-a94e-4309-a370-4238f0a6f909">N°11 del 17/06/2026</a> -&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14345303/Bollettino_vite_10_100626.pdf/3a0e9571-6d86-4bcb-8991-420c7a4b408d">N°10 del 10/06/2026</a> -&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14345303/Bollettino_vite_9_030626.pdf/3629ae2d-c132-436c-bdf2-41682e8d10c5">N°09 del 03/06/2026</a> -&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14345303/Bollettino_vite_8_280526.pdf/9a27a5c9-9627-44e3-856c-c390cf990787">N°08 del 28/05/2026</a> -&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14345303/Bollettino_vite_7_200526.pdf/6c644510-0cb6-4fcc-a5a7-dfb4b4a802b5">N°07 del 20/05/2026</a> -&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14345303/Bollettino_vite_6_130526.pdf/561ba720-a1b3-4c25-8921-40f21b4a4ed5">N°06 del 13/05/2026</a> -&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14345303/Bollettino_vite_5_060526.pdf/dc8e41d6-b66a-4cb5-8cf5-b84751d906ed">N°05 del 06/05/2026</a> -&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14345303/Bollettino_vite_4_290426.pdf/ef00dd37-ad9e-4c13-a2a5-26d30299c899">N°04 del 29/04/2026</a> -&nbsp;<span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><a href="/documents/11979050/14345303/Bollettino_vite_3_230426.pdf/45365ed0-bd9e-455b-b04f-40309cc61bd2">N°03 del 23/04/2026</a> -<a href="/documents/11979050/14345303/Vite_2026_02/059ec793-e5e9-483e-a519-116fd22d7654"> N°02 del 15/04/2026</a> -&nbsp;<a href="/documents/11979050/14345303/Vite_2026_01/6751ad23-20ac-4ead-9ef8-d1d3cc5f7e32">N°01 del 09/04/2026</a></span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
